<title>HONG KONG: HSBC opens new Shanghai offices.</title>
<headline>HSBC opens new Shanghai offices.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong and Shanghai Banking Corp said it had opened its new premises in Shanghai's Pudong district on Monday, and would officially open its Dalian branch on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bank, one of the first foreign banks to receive official approval from the People's Bank of China to conduct yuan business in Shanghai, began offering Chinese currency services in March.</p>
<p>It said the latest openings would bring its branches in China to seven.</p>
<p>It also has three representative offices in China.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
